<title>NETHERLANDS: DSM posts NLG 720 mln 1996 net profit.</title>
<headline>DSM posts NLG 720 mln 1996 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>HEERLEN, Netherlands 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to end-Dec 1996</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit incl. extraordinary items     720  vs  1.07 bln</p>
<p>    Ditto per ordinary share (guilders)    23.83  vs 29.60</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charge			     5  vs  2</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)			   9.00  vs  8.00</p>
<p>NOTE - DSM NV said in January net profit from ordinary operations in 1996 would amount to at least 700 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			  10.26  vs  9.82</p>
<p>    Operating profit				 998  vs  1.52 bln</p>
<p>    Financial charges				 60  vs  58</p>
<p>    Tax						  263  vs  469</p>
<p>    Income from associates			  54  vs  79</p>
<p>    Dividend on preference shares		 28  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net attributable to ord shares	     692  vs  1.07 bln</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
